              <blockquote>
<p>Roblox Player and Roblox Studio Logs are both written to the same folder.</p>
<ul>
<li>On PC, press the WINDOWS KEY and R at the same time. A box called <strong>Run</strong> will appear. Copy and paste or type in the following without quotes:
<ul>
<li>For Win32: "%localappdata%\Roblox\logs"For UWP: “%LOCALAPPDATA%\Packages\ROBLOXCorporation.ROBLOX_55nm5eh3cm0pr\LocalState\logs”</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</blockquote>
